lar, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            关于Aponte Village\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 8px;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei UI\";letter-spacing: 0.4pt;font-size: 14px;'>\n          // 下述文字部分来源于咖篮公众号，以及翻译自Ally Coffee\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 8px;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei UI\";letter-spacing: 0.4pt;font-size: 14px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QEzxCDcLRUkF58lTSMOdZxsmGoPQLic2sKlVbPjrxlyYKD78RB9S0Y0G8gHR01uPClauEBPFSzfhA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei UI\";letter-spacing: 0.4pt;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n          阿邦特小农村落位于哥伦比亚西南部娜玲珑省，属印加部落，历史可以追溯到古老的印加帝国（印加帝国在14世纪晚期殖民了哥伦比亚南部地区，比西班牙人来得更早一些）。他们的祖先曾居住在秘鲁的洛斯安第斯山脉的山顶，是印加帝国军队中游牧战士的后裔。在被征服期间，他们被孤立在高山中，这里成为了他们的避难所，就这样几乎完全与世隔绝地生活了数百年。直到19世纪下半叶，因为橡胶和奎纳的生意，这个群体的记录才再次出现。不幸的是，准军事组织、游击队等的兴起对印加人造成了损害。这些组织频繁地出没于印加人的土地上，强迫部落参与罂粟和海洛因的生产，曾经平静的山区充斥了各种非法种植园和暴力。幸运的是，十多年前，哥伦比亚政府出面资助，印加人将这些坏人驱逐出他们祖先的土地。印加人恢复超过22,000公顷的土地，并发展了一种财政上可持续的治理模式，据此他们成立了原住民人民法院，进一步帮助开垦原住民土地。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QEzxCDcLRUkF58lTSMOdZxlEnY2OHv0xSbNGQzgBeXkibiaufo3DutFNfAKceTCicuCMEUC9MpzaZGQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei UI\";letter-spacing: 0.4pt;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n          也是这十几年间，这里变成了一个自由的地区，\n          <span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;letter-spacing: 0.533333px;\">\n           非法作\n          </span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;letter-spacing: 0.533333px;\">\n           物被根除\n          </span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;letter-spacing: 0.533333px;\">\n           ，\n          </span>\n          没有其他影响，并且取而代之的是一种新的咖啡文化。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei UI\";font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.533333px;'>\n          // 下面是Aponte的一些处理设施照片\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QEzxCDcLRUkF58lTSMOdZxVM4b9Imjak5WulH3ibQg0eS3ibhTaE1icFLhGnHyoMELqc2NRrsibY1kVw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QEzxCDcLRUkF58lTSMOdZxVf5jqseFQVgib1pc9zc5FYX9meQkOo2ibrv7W1LHYs8jeqjwuTtsOW9g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QEzxCDcLRUkF58lTSMOdZxYQJJfW8A0sibTP5NU7ZOhgWxI3ozhsSb1HXo4nu9d3MqmoSkep0Gm0w/640?